<h2 class="mission_subtitle">Our Genesis</h2>
<p><strong class="mission_text">Indie Video Editors was born in Los Angeles at the legendary Venice Beach and emerged from the vision of Yaro Korets and Dmitri Pavlenko, formed after a collaborative art project at Burning Man. We're not just a video editing company: we are partners in storytelling, dedicated to supporting our clients and editors alike.</strong></p>
